      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition\",\n  \"alias\": \"ResNet\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"通过残差学习和捷径连接，缓解深层网络的优化困难。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2016/html/He_Deep_Residual_Learning_CVPR_2016_paper.html\",\n  \"year\": 2016\n}\n```"
