      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Densely Connected Convolutional Networks\",\n  \"alias\": \"DenseNet\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"在密集块内拼接此前各层特征，促进特征复用和信息传递。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2017/html/Huang_Densely_Connected_Convolutional_CVPR_2017_paper.html\",\n  \"year\": 2017\n}\n```"
    },
