      "height": 220,
      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"paperstream\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Aggregated Residual Transformations for Deep Neural Networks\",\n  \"alias\": \"ResNeXt\",\n  \"takeaway\": \"聚合多个相同结构的分支，将分支数量作为深度和宽度之外的设计维度。\",\n  \"url\": \"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2017/html/Xie_Aggregated_Residual_Transformations_CVPR_2017_paper.html\",\n  \"year\": 2017\n}\n```"
